  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bfa 304.02 Scope. Discussion of criteria and procedures followed by governor and council contained in this part shall be descriptive only and shall not be rules binding on the governor and council.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Bfa 100) #5719, eff 10-13-93",
